    "detailed_description": "<h1>\ud83d\udc1eLooking forward to your feedback</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you have any suggestions or feedback, feel free to reach out through any of the following:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Comments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Discussions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >QQ Group: 237694509</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discord (see link on the right)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also access these links directly from the game's main menu.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcc4\u00a0Pick up 4 bills in a row to make one payment</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649670/extras/b840b8657ba01989d3802e87d5469ac1.poster.avif?t=1751585530\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649670/extras/b840b8657ba01989d3802e87d5469ac1.webm?t=1751585530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649670/extras/b840b8657ba01989d3802e87d5469ac1.mp4?t=1751585530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfe0 Explore different rooms to collect items and resources</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649670/extras/61a738c0fc4e3ea137d4638a86585182.poster.avif?t=1751585530\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649670/extras/61a738c0fc4e3ea137d4638a86585182.webm?t=1751585530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649670/extras/61a738c0fc4e3ea137d4638a86585182.mp4?t=1751585530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc31 Various cats will help you along the way</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649670/extras/9b0ebd0c6cd7ad12984a130c212db253.poster.avif?t=1751585530\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649670/extras/9b0ebd0c6cd7ad12984a130c212db253.webm?t=1751585530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649670/extras/9b0ebd0c6cd7ad12984a130c212db253.mp4?t=1751585530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udccc Use all kinds of magical items and stamps</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649670/extras/3f401aa665c8376eac5664c54c71e7ff.poster.avif?t=1751585530\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649670/extras/3f401aa665c8376eac5664c54c71e7ff.webm?t=1751585530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649670/extras/3f401aa665c8376eac5664c54c71e7ff.mp4?t=1751585530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfc6 Spend all your money within the time limit to win</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649670/extras/c08804b11537833f6ba02d8de50038a1.poster.avif?t=1751585530\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649670/extras/c08804b11537833f6ba02d8de50038a1.webm?t=1751585530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649670/extras/c08804b11537833f6ba02d8de50038a1.mp4?t=1751585530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
